{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24227","headline":"春早秋初因时即事兼寄浙东李侍郎 · 白居易","name":"春早秋初因时即事兼寄浙东李侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春早秋初昼夜长，可怜天气好年光。\n和风细动帘帷暖，清露微凝枕簟凉。\n窗下晓眠初减被，池边晚坐乍移牀。\n闲从蕙草侵堦绿，静任槐花满地黄。\n理曲管弦闻後院，熨衣灯火映深房。\n四时新景何人别，遥忆多情李侍郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24227.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24227","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}